title: "AeroSoar: simulation environment and experiment code for causal signal processing of vertical air velocity in autonomous soaring gliders"
abstract: "Simulation environment and experiment code for the study Causal Signal Processing for Vertical Air Velocity Estimation and Thermal Detection in Autonomous Soaring Gliders: A Simulation Study. The project is simulation-first: results use assumed aircraft, atmosphere and sensor models, and no claim of flight readiness is made. No flight data are included."
